{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1344133-about-deviant-and-beast","id":1344133,"title":"About Deviant and Beast.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-27T23:04:16-07:00","id":1344133,"title":"About Deviant and Beast.","content":"Deviant are Kine and can buy kinship?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-27T23:07:37-07:00","id":1344134,"title":"","content":"Kin, not Kine. Kine is for cows. You eat Kine with your Kin.<br /> <br /> But yes, Deviants are Kin and can obtain the Family Ties Condition from Beasts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-28-2019, 03:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T09:29:22-07:00","id":1344208,"title":"","content":"I pity the saps who have pissed off Begotten with Deviant Kinship Nightmares. With names like &quot;Your Flesh Revolts&quot;, &quot;You Are Being Targeted&quot;, &quot;You Will Lose Your Loved Ones&quot;, &quot;They Are Already Here&quot;, Your Skull Runs Over&quot;...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:09:56-07:00","id":1344213,"title":"","content":"Ooo, now I want in. What are some nightmares based on what makes other people fear Deviants?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:17:18-07:00","id":1344217,"title":"","content":"&quot;Your Body is a Cage&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T13:15:33-07:00","id":1344243,"title":"","content":"I can see that going either way but it's a damn cool name either way.<br /> <br /> Man this is hard. Especially finding ground not covered by the General Nightmares. Like, You Deserve This would be my first idea if it wasn't already in the book.<br /> <br /> You Pissed Them Off: something tied to fearing people suddenly turning completely against you for some arbitrary-seeming reason.<br /> <br /> You Never Wanted This: the fear that something you've been doing has been twisted into something monstrous and unecessary by either yourself or toxic followers . tied to Loyalty Touchstone's fear of the lengths their Deviants will go to to protect them<br /> <br /> They Attack Unseen: based on the fear of psychic powers. Removes defense because you can't track the user's attacks anymore, as if you are just being hurt by the air","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 10-28-2019, 04:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T18:03:54-07:00","id":1344787,"title":"","content":"You know, my thought when I saw this thread was how powerful both splats are on the up front. Like, sure, a mage with some xp is dangerous, but both Begotten and Renegade feel like they're pretty front loaded on power (I am not complaining about this*).<br /> <br /> Some poor Hunter or Hero would be in for a world of hurt, especially if they mix up what they're going after.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T21:33:17-07:00","id":1344829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArchonAres</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1344133-about-deviant-and-beast?p=1344787#post1344787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, my thought when I saw this thread was how powerful both splats are on the up front. Like, sure, a mage with some xp is dangerous, but both Begotten and Renegade feel like they're pretty front loaded on power (I am not complaining about this*).<br /> <br /> Some poor Hunter or Hero would be in for a world of hurt, especially if they mix up what they're going after.</div> </div> </div> </div>A lot of splats are like that. Hunters, Heroes, and Mages who try to handle a Changeling or a Sin-Eater off the handle will often find themselves on the wrong foot.<br /> <br /> The problem for all three of them is they often <i>know</i> that that's the case, which means when they <i>are</i> caught on the wrong foot, most of them don't just go into, but rather try and get away and recoup. If they can succeed in that, then you run into the problem of preparation, which can include but is not limited to escalation of violence into ridiculous overkill and collateral, warping the situation to fit their needs, or generally learning what they need to put you down and executing it with scalpel precision.<br /> <br /> The three can be <i>brash</i>, but the three are hard to accuse of being <i>stupid</i>. The ones that survive, anyways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T08:56:25-07:00","id":1344953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1344133-about-deviant-and-beast?p=1344243#post1344243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see that going either way but it's a damn cool name either way.<br /> <br /> Man this is hard. Especially finding ground not covered by the General Nightmares. Like, You Deserve This would be my first idea if it wasn't already in the book.<br /> <br /> You Pissed Them Off: something tied to fearing people suddenly turning completely against you for some arbitrary-seeming reason.<br /> <br /> You Never Wanted This: the fear that something you've been doing has been twisted into something monstrous and unecessary by either yourself or toxic followers . tied to Loyalty Touchstone's fear of the lengths their Deviants will go to to protect them<br /> <br /> They Attack Unseen: based on the fear of psychic powers. Removes defense because you can't track the user's attacks anymore, as if you are just being hurt by the air</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a big fan of &quot;I never wanted this&quot;. thematically fitting and can serve as a revelation to a deviant devoted/renegade.<br /> <br /> &quot;agents everywhere&quot;- a nightmare that focuses on the the paranoia a renegade faces in the outside world","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T07:46:51-07:00","id":1345436,"title":"","content":"Does anyone have the time to make a summary of the Nightmares that already exist that could apply to the thematic fears of Deviant in general? We probably shouldn't get bogged down in individual powers that could inspire Nightmares due to just how varied Deviants can be. But listing existing Nightmares that could apply to Deviants in general or maybe even the themes of specific Clades could help us find the gaps where we could slide in our own concepts.<br /> <br /> So far, generally themewise, I think the Werewolf Kinship Nightmare &quot;Your Rage Consumes You&quot; works for Deviant's Conviction.<br /> <br /> &quot;You Can't Dig It Out&quot; is a good Invasive Nightmare<br /> <br /> You Are A Meat Machine, the Promethean Nightmare works very well for Deviants with their inability to have an internal identity. Maybe the same for You Don't Have A Face<br /> <br /> Anyone finds stuff in the corebook please post it too. Thanks","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 11-02-2019, 10:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}